#Mission Info

$Version: 23.1
$Name:  XSTR("[Rebel] Escorte Aurore", -1)
$Author: Olivier Veinand
$Created: 11/07/26 at 04:00:00
$Modified: 11/07/26 at 04:00:00
$Notes:
This is a FRED2_OPEN created mission for Fate of the Galaxy.
$End Notes:

$Mission Desc:
 XSTR("Premiere mission SpaceSim. Protegez le transport Aurore a bord de votre X-wing. Deux TIE attaquent; votre ailier Red 2 vous assiste. Apres leur destruction, Aurore passe en hyperespace et la mission se termine automatiquement.", -1)
$end_multi_text
